OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSunny spells
OL,6,Fduring the evening. Becoming cloudier
OL,7,Flater with spells of rain punctuated
OL,8,Fby some heavier bursts moving through
OL,9,Ffrom the west. Becoming drier, cooler
OL,10,Fand clearer in the far northwest by
OL,11,Fdawn.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FEarly rain soon clearing to a
OL,14,Fbrighter, fresher-feeling day, with
OL,15,Fsome warm sunny spells and a
OL,16,Fnorthwesterly wind. Cloudier at times
OL,17,Fin the west, with isolated showers
OL,18,Fpossible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
